  "prefLabel": "Inst 103.01 Composition of Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 103.01 Composition of Board.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 205-D:2, I the board shall consist of 9 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 205-D:2, I (a)-(h).\n\n(b) Biennially, the board shall elect or appoint a chairperson and vice-chairperson at the first meeting of the board in a calendar year.\n\nSource. #8492, eff 12-24-05; ss by #10336, eff 5-15-13; ss by #14111, eff 1-17-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/inst100-700.html"
